{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEM_Simplified\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEM Simplified</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A poll asked a number of people if they liked solving mathematics problems. Exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/b/eeb75c3fa2bf62c17293bef58c2ca7619ea1aa87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> answered \"yes.\" What is the fewest possible number of people who could have been asked the question?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e5ebdbc95b052c8ea5d8b33935bd2678044366b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 25 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 50 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Well, we use our critical thinking skills to know that you can’t have .<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or .<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> people (or any fraction for that matter). So, we will be like me while taking this test and do each answer individually (starting from smallest) until one gives us a whole number. \nwhich in this case that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/8/1a85e14e0a7988e45b7fa30bc19e9628e35190c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(D) } 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />. (although this is quite slow so I’d use the other methods posted)\n~pereena come on let's think positively, ok?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of people. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/1/d1165ff047e43d19d9a348990d33e85d27f1a46a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{74}{100} n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"44\" height=\"38\" /> like to do math (I think I am one of them). <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/f/8df619b5f895f850356f63b4a005e5f71b4ae962.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{74}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> simplifies down to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e768c4a8418ceed16d086ddbbc9308b9c4cf4731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{37}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, so the remaining people who don't like math (haters just hate I guess) would also fall under the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> denominator category. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be5ea4d09f84dc246df73b5920b249b013503fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We start by trying every answer from smallest to greatest. We have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is the smallest choice, so we try this. If we polled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/682b2e5e778c8fdf97d6ddfedac7105c68afc9be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> must have said yes, which is clearly impossible, since fractional people can't exist so we discard this answer. If we continue in this matter, we can find that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89b3af1e5541f7e83456dd6920f4d4eb5314c927.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(D) }50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />. \n</p><p>~Baihly2024\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people are polled, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/90100e7ec57be3145070551137e9c47224adb4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, but it's not, so it is not <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people. If 20 people are polled, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/90100e7ec57be3145070551137e9c47224adb4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but it's not, so it is not <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people are polled, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/90100e7ec57be3145070551137e9c47224adb4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but it's not, so it is not <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people are polled, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5db6ea360f9b1367e4db85c18474906401e2c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which it is, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89b3af1e5541f7e83456dd6920f4d4eb5314c927.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(D) }50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />. \n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Our percent is 74\nAssuming the people are in whole numbers…\n</p><p>If it is A) 10, then the percent will have to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/3/603a3a921e33ac24b5418ea221c153f336a5b591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> = 10\n</p><p>If it is B) 20, then the percent will have to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/1/721ee3defa452565563f1f2410b8750f54961267.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {100}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> = 5\n</p><p>If it is C) 25, then the percent will have to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/79193884ade7a8435b633069bc3f0c61566721b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {100}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> = 4\n</p><p>It it is D) 50, then the percent will have to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/698aacb78bbc66d33134e9d9984b554d16c3932c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {100}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> = 2\n</p><p>If it is E) 100, then the percent will have to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031c2fa638963f5c10ac8fe97faba28d22d362e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {100}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> = 1\n</p><p>In this case, 74 only fits D and E, and because D is less, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89b3af1e5541f7e83456dd6920f4d4eb5314c927.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(D) }50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" /> is the correct answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb381b3708f7176e5af7d38633e839adfde50a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74 \\% = \\frac{74}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" /> by definition. This fraction can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e768c4a8418ceed16d086ddbbc9308b9c4cf4731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{37}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/78916550838bd31d66e4cdefbc366edb11fd00bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$37$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people said \"Yes\". Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/6/806757a9c0efaa716cada91d906be259d490dc0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(37,50) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />, if this fraction was divided any further, we would have fractional numerator and denominator, which is clearly impossible. Therefore, the minimum number of people surveyed was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/8/1a85e14e0a7988e45b7fa30bc19e9628e35190c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(D) } 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />.\n~Ingeniouspeacock36\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U\">https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U</a>\n</p><p>~TheSmartGreekMathDude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk\">https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEM_Simplified\">Video Solution by STEM Simplified</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEM Simplified\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D2Evil9nHQM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D2Evil9nHQM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Thinking Feet\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/J4t0ynSIx5g\">https://youtu.be/J4t0ynSIx5g</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_.28AIME_Qualifier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GmtxMC-W1I&amp;t=726s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GmtxMC-W1I&amp;t=726s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_.28AIME_Qualifier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1G5Me6gE7j/\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1G5Me6gE7j/</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; wid